OL,3,GNEWSAWork due to begin on new police
OL,4,Aheadquarters
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is due to begin on Surrey Police's
OL,7,Fnew eastern headquarters, three years
OL,8,Fafter it was forced to vacate its
OL,9,FReigate base after the discovery of
OL,10,Funstable reinforced autoclaved aerated
OL,11,Fconcrete (Raac).
OL,13,FThe force was granted planning
OL,14,Fpermission for the Cleeve Road site in
OL,15,FLeatherhead in November and, according
OL,16,Fto papers filed to Mole Valley District
OL,17,FCouncil, expects to start preparatory
OL,18,Fwork on 7 September.
OL,20,FIt has been temporarily based at Surrey
OL,21,FFire & Rescue Service's former site in
OL,22,FWray Park, Reigate.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
