OL,3,GNEWSAWork due to begin on new police
OL,4,Aheadquarters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey Police spokesperson said the
OL,7,Fnew site would be "financially
OL,8,Fsustainable" and "ensure officers and
OL,9,Fstaff had the facilities needed to
OL,10,Finvestigate crime and keep communities
OL,11,Fsafe".
